

.:[ list of devmod module commands ]:.


## sole devmod classification : every unlisted or unknown command is unsafe ##
## [ safe loading never compiles unlisted commands ; unsafe unloading uses  ##
## the complement of this list ]                                            ##
##
base.devmod.cmd_list.safe = b32-elf core-subs current-umask \
                            decode-harmonic-ref deparse-code dump dump-env \
                            dump-keys elf-b32 elf-num extract-line-map get \
                            inline-subroutines list-subs mem-allocated \
                            permission-setup receive-multiline since true \
                            true-int unload-devmod unload-unsafe

